Done. Spec created at `artifacts/scd40/outputs/spec_scd40.md`.

Highlights:
- Component `scd4x` (ESPhome docs + source copied to outputs), datasheet downloaded via wayback to `prompt0a/datasheet/scd40.pdf`, converted with `main.py`.
- Spec covers I²C address `0x62`, 400 kHz bus, CRC-8 (0x31/0xff), full command map, init sequence, and conversions:
  - `CO2 = word[0]`, `T = -45 + 175·word[1]/65535`, `RH = 100·word[2]/65535`
- 22 worked CRC-verified test vectors (CO₂ 500 ppm `0x01f4`, temp 25 °C `0x6667`, RH 37 % `0x5eb9`, FRC −50 ppm `0x7fce`, etc.), all raw-16-bit == full register word.
- Marked SCD41/SCD43-only features (single-shot, ASC periods) as such. Pin-layout figure was lost in extraction — flagged to confirm against datasheet Figure 3.

Feedback written to `feedback/scd40/prompt0a.md`.
